{"vid":"D5c-zXGqCME","source":"D5c-zXGqCME.en.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":0.4,"txt":"♫ Music ♫"},{"t":10.9,"txt":"Are you interested in how electrical systems work?"},{"t":14.1,"txt":"Do you like precision"},{"t":15.3,"txt":"and working with others to complete a project?"},{"t":18,"txt":"Are you good at math?"},{"t":19.8,"txt":"Then you may \"get a charge\" out of a career as an electrician."},{"t":24.3,"txt":"Electricians install, alter, repair,"},{"t":27.6,"txt":"and maintain electrical systems that are designed"},{"t":30.3,"txt":"to provide power for all types of equipment,"},{"t":32.8,"txt":"buildings, structures, and premises."},{"t":36,"txt":"They ensure these systems function properly"},{"t":38.3,"txt":"and adhere to all applicable laws,"},{"t":40.6,"txt":"codes, and regulations."},{"t":42.9,"txt":"To get the details of \"watt's\" happening in this career,"},{"t":46.1,"txt":"we spoke to an electrician working in Alberta."},{"t":49.5,"txt":"[Beeping]"},{"t":51.1,"txt":"♫ Music ♫"},{"t":52.7,"txt":"[Drilling]"},{"t":54.7,"txt":"Hi, my name is Barbie, and I am an electrician."},{"t":59.9,"txt":"I build electrical systems and bring them into buildings."},{"t":63.8,"txt":"I troubleshoot any kind of power that isn't working"},{"t":67.2,"txt":"in the buildings and I make it work."},{"t":70.1,"txt":"An electrician can work anywhere."},{"t":72.2,"txt":"We can work industrial,"},{"t":74,"txt":"you can work as a commercial electrician,"},{"t":76.4,"txt":"which is what I'm currently working as,"},{"t":78.2,"txt":"you can work residential,"},{"t":80.2,"txt":"you can also work in the hospitals, in schools,"},{"t":83.1,"txt":"there's so many different areas you can work as an electrician."},{"t":86.2,"txt":"Any place that has electricity and power"},{"t":89.1,"txt":"will need an electrician to"},{"t":90.8,"txt":"to wire it."},{"t":91.8,"txt":"\"Your retractable lifelines, your lanyard...\""},{"t":93.6,"txt":"A typical day for us would be"},{"t":95.2,"txt":"starting off with all of our safety protocols,"},{"t":97.3,"txt":"uh, getting that in"},{"t":98.6,"txt":"in place,"},{"t":99.7,"txt":"interpreting all of your electrical,"},{"t":101.6,"txt":"your mechanical, your architectural drawings,"},{"t":104.6,"txt":"and then from there it's building our"},{"t":107.9,"txt":"infrastructure of our electrical system:"},{"t":110,"txt":"so you have to drill your holes,"},{"t":111.9,"txt":"you have to mount your boxes,"},{"t":113.2,"txt":"you have to run your pipe,"},{"t":115.3,"txt":"and then you can run your wire."},{"t":117.1,"txt":"From there you can mount all of your devices"},{"t":120.1,"txt":"and then you can turn it all on."},{"t":124.4,"txt":"Some of the things that will help you in your trade"},{"t":126.4,"txt":"will include: being mechanically inclined,"},{"t":129.4,"txt":"having an aptitude for math."},{"t":131.4,"txt":"It also helps to distinguish colours"},{"t":134.2,"txt":"when you're working with colour-coded wires."},{"t":138.2,"txt":"You need to be fit."},{"t":139.4,"txt":"You need to be able to lift 50 pounds"},{"t":142.1,"txt":"and you have to be able to climb ladders up and down."},{"t":144.3,"txt":"You're always climbing up and down stairs."},{"t":146.1,"txt":"You're on your feet all day."},{"t":147.2,"txt":"[Drilling]"},{"t":148.9,"txt":"Some of the tools you'll need for the job"},{"t":151,"txt":"are going to be: drills,"},{"t":152.3,"txt":"your pliers, your wire strippers,"},{"t":154.4,"txt":"depending if you're pulling wire,"},{"t":155.8,"txt":"your tape measure, that's a given."},{"t":157.5,"txt":"You're going to use your volt meter,"},{"t":159.3,"txt":"and always screwdrivers."},{"t":162.3,"txt":"To work in Alberta, an electrician must be one of the following:"},{"t":165.9,"txt":"a registered apprentice,"},{"t":167.8,"txt":"an Alberta-certified journeyperson,"},{"t":170.7,"txt":"or someone that holds a recognized"},{"t":172.6,"txt":"related trade certificate"},{"t":174.8,"txt":"from outside of Alberta."},{"t":177.3,"txt":"To become an electrician, you need to"},{"t":179.5,"txt":"have your high school diploma"},{"t":180.9,"txt":"or pass an entrance exam."},{"t":183.5,"txt":"Then to register with Alberta Apprenticeship,"},{"t":186,"txt":"apprentices must then find a company"},{"t":188,"txt":"willing to hire and train them."},{"t":190,"txt":"\"So two and a half, and eight and a quarter...\""},{"t":192.7,"txt":"If you're super outgoing and ambitious,"},{"t":195.1,"txt":"you're great with working with other people,"},{"t":197.6,"txt":"you can become a foreperson,"},{"t":199.2,"txt":"you can go into estimator,"},{"t":201.5,"txt":"project management,"},{"t":202.7,"txt":"you can open up your own contracting company if you want."},{"t":206.6,"txt":"Like there's so many different facets that you can go down"},{"t":209.4,"txt":"especially if you're ambitious."},{"t":212.5,"txt":"I didn't want just a job."},{"t":213.9,"txt":"I wanted a career"},{"t":214.9,"txt":"where I was going to constantly evolve"},{"t":217,"txt":"and constantly learn."},{"t":218.4,"txt":"In electrical, you're always learning."},{"t":221.1,"txt":"You can work in this trade for 40 years"},{"t":223.3,"txt":"and still not know everything."},{"t":224.6,"txt":"And that's one of the things that attracted me to this industry."},{"t":228,"txt":"\"Do you have five-sixteenths?\""},{"t":229.1,"txt":"\"Yep.\""},{"t":229.6,"txt":"The most satisfying part of my job"},{"t":231.8,"txt":"is turning a switch on"},{"t":233.6,"txt":"and all the lights work."},{"t":235.2,"txt":"You've finished piping,"},{"t":236.6,"txt":"you finished pulling the wire,"},{"t":238.5,"txt":"and you turn that switch on"},{"t":240.2,"txt":"and they all come on."},{"t":242.1,"txt":"It's awesome."},{"t":243.5,"txt":"Best feeling of my job."},{"t":246.8,"txt":"To stay \"current\" in this career"},{"t":249.1,"txt":"requires an aptitude for math"},{"t":251.1,"txt":"and being methodical."},{"t":252.6,"txt":"Organization, communication, safety,"},{"t":255.6,"txt":"and problem solving skills are also important."},{"t":259.2,"txt":"It's also useful to have stamina"},{"t":261.2,"txt":"and be comfortable working at heights."},{"t":263.5,"txt":"If you enjoy dealing with customers"},{"t":265.5,"txt":"and working with others,"},{"t":266.8,"txt":"a career as an electrician"},{"t":268.4,"txt":"may be your creative \"outlet.\""},{"t":271.2,"txt":"\"Plug in\" to the details of this occupation,"},{"t":274,"txt":"including training requirements and salary ranges,"},{"t":277.2,"txt":"in the occupational profile on the alis website."},{"t":280.4,"txt":"While you're there,"},{"t":281.6,"txt":"check out some related occupations,"},{"t":283.5,"txt":"including electrical engineering technologist,"},{"t":286.2,"txt":"communication technician,"},{"t":287.8,"txt":"and safety codes officer."},{"t":290.8,"txt":"Explore the possibilities!"},{"t":292.7,"txt":"Go to alis.alberta.ca."}],"words":[{"t":0.409,"w":"♫"},{"t":0.409,"w":"Music"},{"t":0.409,"w":"♫"},{"t":10.925,"w":"Are"},{"t":10.925,"w":"you"},{"t":10.925,"w":"interested"},{"t":10.925,"w":"in"},{"t":10.925,"w":"how"},{"t":10.925,"w":"electrical"},{"t":10.925,"w":"systems"},{"t":10.925,"w":"work?"},{"t":14.115,"w":"Do"},{"t":14.115,"w":"you"},{"t":14.115,"w":"like"},{"t":14.115,"w":"precision"},{"t":15.345,"w":"and"},{"t":15.345,"w":"working"},{"t":15.345,"w":"with"},{"t":15.345,"w":"others"},{"t":15.345,"w":"to"},{"t":15.345,"w":"complete"},{"t":15.345,"w":"a"},{"t":15.345,"w":"project?"},{"t":17.997,"w":"Are"},{"t":17.997,"w":"you"},{"t":17.997,"w":"good"},{"t":17.997,"w":"at"},{"t":17.997,"w":"math?"},{"t":19.827,"w":"Then"},{"t":19.827,"w":"you"},{"t":19.827,"w":"may"},{"t":19.827,"w":"\"get"},{"t":19.827,"w":"a"},{"t":19.827,"w":"charge\""},{"t":19.827,"w":"out"},{"t":19.827,"w":"of"},{"t":19.827,"w":"a"},{"t":19.827,"w":"career"},{"t":19.827,"w":"as"},{"t":19.827,"w":"an"},{"t":19.827,"w":"electrician."},{"t":24.28,"w":"Electricians"},{"t":24.28,"w":"install,"},{"t":24.28,"w":"alter,"},{"t":24